From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Subject: [PATCH] add Linux/i860 support

System call decoding, tampering through PTRACE_SET_SYSCALL_INFO and the test fixes for musl and
the time64 only table. No -k: there is no unwinder for i860.

Against upstream commit be6eb508a597e0418a670b54a7f159bab34d2db9 (doc: clarify injection option repetition rules).
Branch i860 at cecc839dd. Tested in the MAME magicst2 model only, not on real hardware.

Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
